# Student Registration CRUD Web Application

A Java-based web application developed using Java Servlets, JSP, JDBC, and MySQL/PostgreSQL.

## Features
- Add new students
- View all registered students
- Edit student details
- Delete student records
- Database connectivity using JDBC
- Duplicate email validation
- Form validation and error handling
- Responsive user interface using Bootstrap

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Servlets
- JSP
- JDBC
- HTML
- CSS
- Bootstrap
- MySQL / PostgreSQL
- Apache Tomcat
- Eclipse IDE
- Maven

## Project Purpose
This project demonstrates Java web development concepts, CRUD operations, database connectivity, and MVC architecture.